    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Welcome to "La Soleil".


    Interact with "F", Harvest with "H" and
    to open inventory press "ESC".

    You have to maintain the cafe as long as
    you can! At the start of every new week you''ll have to pay rent. If you do not
    have enough money for rent, you lose!


    To start your day, you must open
    the cafe with the bottom right button. That will make the customers come in,
    if there are empty spots. The customers will walk towards your cash register,
    there you can talk with them using "F". You can accept their request or decline.
    Once you accept be sure to remeber their order and get their coffee to them quickly,
    otherwise they''ll leave. Also the sooner you give them their order, the more
    money you make. You can also access the storage with "F" and put some things
    you don''t need there. If you wish to liven up the atmosphere in your cafe, you
    can play vinyls. Interact with the gramophone using "F" and insert vinyl. NOTE:
    you''ll insert the first vinyl in your inventory (first row and the most left
    slot). To plant in your greenhouse press "F" and harvest with "H" (you plant
    on the spot you''re standing on, the same with harvesting), just remeber that
    you need seed to plant something. You can buy seeds in grocery store, to travel
    go towards your door and press "F", choose your location to travel. Traveling
    costs time!


    You can open this in inventory, press "?" button.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
